 title=\"Allow users to upload avatars or choose them from your media library.\" rel=\"ugc\">WP User Avatars</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-user-groups/\" title=\"Group users together with taxonomies &amp; terms.\" rel=\"ugc\">WP User Groups</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-user-profiles/\" title=\"A sophisticated way to edit users in WordPress.\" rel=\"ugc\">WP User Profiles</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
